{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A narrative survival game in a dying pandemicpunk world.\u00a0Enter the Plaguelands, Crow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crow's Requiem is a <i>cRPG meets survival visual novel</i></strong> where\u00a0you are a licensed body collector navigating\u00a0a dystopic Pandemicpunk\u00a0world,\u00a0 shaped by never-ending waves of illness.\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/bf045bcd26ae0093a63121c6a5e8bc11.avif?t=1753109831\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive</strong> your truck, <strong>collect</strong> the dead, and <strong>meet</strong> New Horizon's citizens &amp; factions.<br>Just be sure to<strong> maintain your Humanity and Infection in check</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The CROWS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who are you in the Plaguelands: <strong>a Listener, a Whisperer, or an Enforcer Crow</strong>? This choice will start shaping your gameplay, options, and destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/c2f9bec03ebd3044e53202f0bf4a3f37.poster.avif?t=1753109831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/c2f9bec03ebd3044e53202f0bf4a3f37.webm?t=1753109831\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/c2f9bec03ebd3044e53202f0bf4a3f37.mp4?t=1753109831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your training was fleeting, but you can surely handle the dead, right?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXAMINE</strong>: Analyze their condition<i> (click and hold)</i>;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEAL</strong>: hold the illness in the body\u00a0<i>(click and drag side to side)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLUG</strong>: plug\u00a0natural cavities \u00a0<i>(multi-click)</i>;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BAG</strong>: Then, bag them<i> (click and drag down)</i> and return to the truck.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/00b48cc1690c5496eddd3ac6686257b2.poster.avif?t=1753109831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/00b48cc1690c5496eddd3ac6686257b2.webm?t=1753109831\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple enough, right? Well, once you're done, another dead awaits.\u00a0\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>Collect your payment</strong> at the Medical Center before the day's end;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your <strong>upkeep</strong> is due, and the Taxman is more unavoidable than the\u00a0illness.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore New Horizon and its forgotten shopping malls, where believers search for holy signs on dirty napkins. Or, enter lawless compounds where a gun speaks louder than authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/241a39409d7d77d0854f234328953a80.avif?t=1753109831\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The FACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact with the Military Anarchist and Cultist factions</strong> who split control over the city. Do their bidding loyally or double-cross each fool who crosses your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/ab6922f4272b46c2c7925309ffc10b87.poster.avif?t=1753109831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/ab6922f4272b46c2c7925309ffc10b87.webm?t=1753109831\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your CHOICES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your choices heal the world, make it better?<br>Or will you stoke the sickly flames of the end, breaking it beyond all repair?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city echoes through empty streets...<br><strong>Who are you, Crow?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859230?t=1753109831","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/41bed6e3bcf2063d4351156afa5b2b47219d64ae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753109831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/cd612bdcbe9083d4530e66fd2ebec444f5dfb45c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753109831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/cd612bdcbe9083d4530e66fd2ebec444f5dfb45c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753109831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains violent, quarantine, pandemic, political, religious, physical and mental health, and death themes. While this content is included purposefully for narrative and experiential reasons, we encourage players' discretion."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A narrative survival game in a dying pandemicpunk world.\u00a0Enter the Plaguelands, Crow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crow's Requiem is a <i>cRPG meets survival visual novel</i></strong> where\u00a0you are a licensed body collector navigating\u00a0a dystopic Pandemicpunk\u00a0world,\u00a0 shaped by never-ending waves of illness.\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/bf045bcd26ae0093a63121c6a5e8bc11.avif?t=1753109831\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive</strong> your truck, <strong>collect</strong> the dead, and <strong>meet</strong> New Horizon's citizens &amp; factions.<br>Just be sure to<strong> maintain your Humanity and Infection in check</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The CROWS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who are you in the Plaguelands: <strong>a Listener, a Whisperer, or an Enforcer Crow</strong>? This choice will start shaping your gameplay, options, and destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/c2f9bec03ebd3044e53202f0bf4a3f37.poster.avif?t=1753109831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/c2f9bec03ebd3044e53202f0bf4a3f37.webm?t=1753109831\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/c2f9bec03ebd3044e53202f0bf4a3f37.mp4?t=1753109831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your training was fleeting, but you can surely handle the dead, right?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXAMINE</strong>: Analyze their condition<i> (click and hold)</i>;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEAL</strong>: hold the illness in the body\u00a0<i>(click and drag side to side)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLUG</strong>: plug\u00a0natural cavities \u00a0<i>(multi-click)</i>;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BAG</strong>: Then, bag them<i> (click and drag down)</i> and return to the truck.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/00b48cc1690c5496eddd3ac6686257b2.poster.avif?t=1753109831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/00b48cc1690c5496eddd3ac6686257b2.webm?t=1753109831\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple enough, right? Well, once you're done, another dead awaits.\u00a0\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>Collect your payment</strong> at the Medical Center before the day's end;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your <strong>upkeep</strong> is due, and the Taxman is more unavoidable than the\u00a0illness.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore New Horizon and its forgotten shopping malls, where believers search for holy signs on dirty napkins. Or, enter lawless compounds where a gun speaks louder than authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/241a39409d7d77d0854f234328953a80.avif?t=1753109831\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The FACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact with the Military Anarchist and Cultist factions</strong> who split control over the city. Do their bidding loyally or double-cross each fool who crosses your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/ab6922f4272b46c2c7925309ffc10b87.poster.avif?t=1753109831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/ab6922f4272b46c2c7925309ffc10b87.webm?t=1753109831\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your CHOICES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your choices heal the world, make it better?<br>Or will you stoke the sickly flames of the end, breaking it beyond all repair?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city echoes through empty streets...<br><strong>Who are you, Crow?</strong></p>","developers":["Ex Ignorantia"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/12a7b3960d06a74433037c872b79c9f6c8bfccc3/header.jpg?t=1753109831","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257168373,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168373/movie480.mp4?t=1752849964","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168373/movie_max.mp4?t=1752849964"},"name":"Crow's Requiem | Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168373/3c1996ccba4b0065aa03a08d1ceb46d285f3f2f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752849964","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168373/movie480_